# Card

A **card** is the typed, versioned envelope Wyrd uses for every component it
governs. Every kind shares the same outer shape; the `spec` carries the fields
specific to that kind.

## The envelope

```yaml
apiVersion: wyrd/v1
metadata:
  space: default
  name: my-component
  version: "0.1.0"
  labels: {}
  annotations: {}
kind: Data          # selects the spec schema
spec:               # kind-specific payload
  ...
relationships: []   # derived by the server from CardRefs in spec
status:
  phase: active
```

Every registered card — of any kind — carries exactly these six top-level
fields. The author supplies four; the server owns two.

<DataTable
